@startuml TemplateMethod

title Template Method Pattern — BaseSpectralAnalyzer

skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam classFontStyle bold

interface ISpectralAnalyzer <<interface>> {
  + GetFrequencyCutoffAsync(filePath : string) : Task<double>
  + IsTrueLosslessAsync(filePath : string) : Task<bool>
}

abstract class BaseSpectralAnalyzer <<abstract>> {
  - {static} LosslessMinCutoff : double = 22000
  - {static} Mp3CutoffThreshold : double = 16000
  - {static} AacCutoffThreshold : double = 20000
  --
  + GetFrequencyCutoffAsync(filePath : string) : Task<double>
  + IsTrueLosslessAsync(filePath : string) : Task<bool>
  # {abstract} DecodeToPcmAsync(filePath : string) : Task<float[]>
  - {static} AnalyzeSpectrum(samples : float[]) : double
}

class FlacSpectralAnalyzer {
  # DecodeToPcmAsync(filePath : string) : Task<float[]>
}

class WavSpectralAnalyzer {
  # DecodeToPcmAsync(filePath : string) : Task<float[]>
}

class AlacSpectralAnalyzer {
  # DecodeToPcmAsync(filePath : string) : Task<float[]>
}

class AiffSpectralAnalyzer {
  # DecodeToPcmAsync(filePath : string) : Task<float[]>
}

BaseSpectralAnalyzer ..|> ISpectralAnalyzer : realizes

FlacSpectralAnalyzer --|> BaseSpectralAnalyzer
WavSpectralAnalyzer --|> BaseSpectralAnalyzer
AlacSpectralAnalyzer --|> BaseSpectralAnalyzer
AiffSpectralAnalyzer --|> BaseSpectralAnalyzer

note right of BaseSpectralAnalyzer
  **Template Method** (invariant skeleton):
  GetFrequencyCutoffAsync()
    1. calls DecodeToPcmAsync()  ← hook
    2. calls AnalyzeSpectrum()   ← invariant

  IsTrueLosslessAsync()
    1. calls GetFrequencyCutoffAsync()
    2. compares to LosslessMinCutoff
end note

note bottom of FlacSpectralAnalyzer
  Primitive Operation
  (hook implementation)
  DecodeToPcmAsync() decodes FLAC → PCM
end note

